WEBVTT


00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:20.800
Brought to you by DLAznMovies. com
Fansubbed by Shadowlord


00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.690
So you're here, after all?


00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:26.700
It's food.


00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.240
Eat it.


00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.540
It's a gratuitous
service from the landlady.


00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:50.250
When I look at you,
you're pretty...


00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:59.600
Don't mind me.


00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:04.310
You're an abandoned
Goze, right?


00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:09.510
So you know the
taste of men, right?


00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.410
I don't know what I don't cut.


00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.080
Because I'm blind.


00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:29.790
I'm not really interested
in a love affair with a man.


00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:32.780
But...


00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:37.820
wouldn't it be nice to be warmed
by someone in a cold night?


00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:46.040
Women who can see consider
their appearance to be important.


00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.870
But we don't care.


00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.180
But still, we Goze...


00:05:55.420 --> 00:06:00.620
are being chased away from our
comrades if we get involved with men.


00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:03.020
Oh well...


00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:06.290
What a strange law!


00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.900
If no one gives us warmth,...


00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.530
we have to to
freeze to death...


00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:22.870
Hey.


00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.340
Are you listening?


00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:33.150
You've got involved
with men, too, right?


00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:36.290
Am I right?


00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.590
Hey!


00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:45.230
Someone has come!


00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:02.670
You know that I can't see,
so don't make fun of me!


00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:04.140
What?


00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:10.080
Give me the money as agreed.


00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:11.720
Shut up!


00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.560
Pay!


00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:53.250
Hey.


00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:55.750
There's another one.


00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:01.600
What a beautiful
woman, brother!


00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:05.100
Let's see...


00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:08.300
Yes.


00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.500
Are you a Goze, too?


00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.970
My brother has asked
you something! Answer!


00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:18.550
Please don't mind me.


00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.410
What're you sayin'?


00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:23.380
Don't mind me.


00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:27.130
Oh, whatever,
come with me! Hey!


00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.330
Wait!


00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:34.530
Wait a second!


00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:39.970
Don't you see that
she doesn't want to?


00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:43.400
Yeah.


00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.580
What do you want...


00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.980
I'm just a transient.


00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.250
Would you please do me a
favor and leave her alone?


00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.270
Wai... wai... wai...


00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.350
wai... wai... wait,
wait, wait! Wait!


00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:23.880
Don't let us shed
blood uselessly.


00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.650
Wait a second!


00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:30.490
Let's have a deal.


00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.790
What about this?


00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.500
It's a promissory
note, worth ten ryou.


00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:19.940
It's a real one.


00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:26.740
You think you'll save
her, if you give us money?


00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:32.920
Brother, if we kill him, we'll
get the ten ryou and the woman!


00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:36.310
That's mean!


00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:45.030
What's wrong?


00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:47.020
Come!


00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:21.030
What are you doing, bitch?!


00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.180
Hey!


00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:14.710
You!


00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:15.340
Hey. What's your name?


00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:25.720
Maybe I should
introduce myself first.


00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:30.560
I'm Touma Fujihira
from Shimousa.


00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.430
Right now, I'm just
wandering around.


00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:34.630
I'm traveling in the
pursuit of knowledge.


00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:38.210
But when I saved you...


00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.930
my promissory note
got ripped apart, so...


00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:43.770
I have to find a job now
and earn some money...


00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.210
or I cannot
continue my journey.


00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:50.110
Well, I have quite a lot of
self-confidence in my skills.


00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:53.050
A job as a bodyguard or
something similar would be nice...


00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:59.750
You've saved me?


00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:03.960
Well, even though
you've killed them...


00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:06.760
I could've defeated
those guys alone.


00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.430
Huh.


00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:18.080
You've laughed, right?


00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:22.410
You've laughed.
You've laughed, right?


00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.980
"Huh?" You've laughed
at me with a "huh".


00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:28.420
I cannot let you get away
after mocking a samurai!


00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:41.900
Who is this woman?


00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:16.500
Goze, I'll show
you a nice inn.


00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.370
Where's the gambling den?


00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:24.380
The gambling den is
outside the inn town, but...


00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:26.980
I'll lead you there!


00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:31.410
Do you want to gamble, Goze?


00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:37.750
Do you want to stay
here for tonight?


00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:50.240
Are you ready?
I'll roll the dice.


00:16:58.710 --> 00:16:59.510
Make your bets.


00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:01.340
Chou.


00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:02.740
Han.


00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:12.050
No one seems to know him.


00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.890
No more han?


00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:18.860
Chou.


00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.020
Make your bets.


00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:27.230
Han.


00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.280
The bets are set. Win or loss.


00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:35.280
Two and four, chou.


00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:45.020
Oh!


00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:53.630
The Banki gang...


00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.200
Almost no money left...


00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:07.070
What a loudmouth.


00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.140
Hey!


00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:15.220
I can't concentrate when
you're standing there!


00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.920
Come here. Do you
want to challenge me?


00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.030
So...


00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:30.870
Let us continue.


00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:34.540
Are you ready?
I'll roll the dice.


00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:42.240
Make your bets.


00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:43.450
Chou.


00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:44.240
Han.


00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:45.580
Make your bets.


00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.680
Han.


00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.890
Yes. No one says chou?


00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:52.960
Chou.


00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:53.550
Han.


00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:54.790
Anyone else?


00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.450
Make your bets.


00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:58.730
Chou.


00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:04.600
Chou.


00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:08.430
Make your bets!
Make your bets!


00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.910
Yes. No one says chou?


00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:15.140
Yes, make your bets.


00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:17.410
Chou.


00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.490
The bets are set.


00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:24.050
Five and three, chou.


00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:44.440
Han.


00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:49.180
Make your bets.
Make your bets.


00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:50.840
Han.


00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:53.150
Yes. No one says chou?


00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.190
It's han!


00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:57.350
Anyone else? Make your bets.


00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:58.820
Chou.


00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:01.120
Han.


00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:04.320
Chou.


00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.660
The bets are set.


00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:08.100
Win or loss.


00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.030
Four and one, han.


00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.940
Here it comes...


00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:23.210
Chou.


00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:26.410
So, make your bets.
Make your bets.


00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:30.420
Chou.


00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:34.120
Two and six, chou.


00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.230
Next, next!


00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:51.200
Yeah, another round!


00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.880
OK, let's continue.


00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.610
I'll start.


00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:15.500
I don't need any light.


00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.190
Oh, right.


00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:20.910
But while you're
at the inn town...


00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:24.030
I'll see for you,
so be unconcerned.


00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:33.180
Thank you.


00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:36.480
I've got ten ryou.


00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:40.120
So I've paid my debt.


00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:43.550
Boy.


00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:47.230
Because I've got a lot of money now,
could you please lead me to a decent inn?


00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:49.500
Don't call me
boy. I'm Kotarou.


00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:00.110
Hey, wait! Wait!


00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.350
Wait, I said wait!


00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.010
What do you want?


00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:08.350
You! How dare you to
make fools out of us?


00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:10.250
We didn't do anything...


00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:12.550
You must've
tricked us somehow.


00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:16.220
We didn't do anything unfair.


00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:20.160
Give us our money back. That's
the only way to save your life.


00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:23.900
I refuse.


00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:25.100
What?!


00:22:26.670 --> 00:22:29.940
If you want my money, you
have to take it by force!


00:22:30.110 --> 00:22:31.600
What?!


00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:33.440
Yeah!


00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:35.650
Don't interfere this time.


00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:41.550
Look, he's shaking.


00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:43.090
How pathetic.


00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:44.780
Come and get me!


00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:53.200
Die!


00:22:58.570 --> 00:23:00.270
Thank you again!


00:23:11.150 --> 00:23:12.280
Wow...


00:23:17.820 --> 00:23:19.290
Oh, there they are!


00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:22.060
Are they already dead?!


00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:27.160
You're great, huh?


00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:29.660
Five men with
just one sword...


00:23:29.870 --> 00:23:32.240
That serves those
Banki gangsters right!


00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:34.770
Banki gang?


00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:36.530
They're a hostile gang,
freeloading on our inn town.


00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:39.300
You're very talented.


00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:45.920
I'm Toraji from the Shirakawa group and I'm
responsible for this inn town called Bitou.


00:23:46.450 --> 00:23:50.580
Master, I want to hire
you as a bodyguard.


00:23:50.860 --> 00:23:51.520
What?


00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:55.220
I'll pay you well.
What about twenty ryou?


00:23:57.360 --> 00:23:58.660
No, no, no...


00:23:58.770 --> 00:23:59.560
Isn't it enough?


00:24:00.700 --> 00:24:03.130
OK, I know you're very good...


00:24:03.700 --> 00:24:07.400
So what about thirty ryou?


00:24:08.340 --> 00:24:09.670
Thirty ryou.


00:24:09.980 --> 00:24:11.380
Toraji.


00:24:18.950 --> 00:24:21.010
OK, it's settled.


00:24:21.190 --> 00:24:22.620
What's your name, master?


00:24:24.090 --> 00:24:26.350
I'm Touma Fujihira.


00:24:26.790 --> 00:24:27.690
Tonma? (Note: means "fool")


00:24:28.430 --> 00:24:30.900
Idiot. It's Touma.


00:24:31.430 --> 00:24:32.520
Kotarou.


00:24:32.630 --> 00:24:34.660
Have you brought him here?


00:24:34.770 --> 00:24:35.830
Yes!


00:24:36.240 --> 00:24:39.540
You did a great job. I'll
buy you dumplings tomorrow.


00:24:41.310 --> 00:24:43.670
Oh, Goze, wait!


00:24:45.210 --> 00:24:46.540
Is she your companion?


00:24:47.310 --> 00:24:50.440
No, not really...


00:24:50.550 --> 00:24:51.450
I see.


00:24:51.550 --> 00:24:53.450
OK, this way, master.


00:24:54.390 --> 00:24:56.820
Let's go. After you, master.


00:24:58.120 --> 00:24:59.320
It's this way. Please...


00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:04.520
You're really good, miss.


00:25:06.970 --> 00:25:09.730
I'm sure you can finish
the Banki off easily!


00:25:11.710 --> 00:25:15.470
But are you fine with this? It was
you, who killed them, after all...


00:25:20.150 --> 00:25:22.240
You really don't want
to stay in an inn?


00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:25.180
A shrine or something
like that would be enough.


00:25:25.290 --> 00:25:28.020
Come with me, then.
It's not very far.


00:25:40.670 --> 00:25:41.530
Right!


00:25:41.640 --> 00:25:46.070
My father says he knows
a blind laido master.


00:25:56.550 --> 00:25:57.710
I'm back, father!


00:26:07.790 --> 00:26:10.020
Who is this woman?


00:26:10.400 --> 00:26:14.270
She's a Goze. She's
searching someone...


00:26:15.970 --> 00:26:20.410
Have you lied again and
brought a woman here?


00:26:20.510 --> 00:26:21.870
Father!


00:26:31.280 --> 00:26:33.910
Heh, you're
definitely a woman.


00:26:34.220 --> 00:26:37.520
But aren't you even
dirtier than me?!


00:26:37.660 --> 00:26:40.060
Don't make fun of me!


00:26:44.500 --> 00:26:45.860
Don't kill dad!


00:27:00.880 --> 00:27:05.510
It seems he really
wants to have a mother...


00:27:06.650 --> 00:27:12.150
But I don't really need one.


00:27:15.560 --> 00:27:18.430
Oh, no... This story...


00:27:19.100 --> 00:27:20.730
Oh, yes, yes. And...


00:27:20.870 --> 00:27:25.200
In three days,
Kataoka Hasshuu will...


00:27:25.310 --> 00:27:28.170
come to the Bitou Inn.


00:27:28.940 --> 00:27:32.670
If everything goes well,
he'll beat the Banki gang...


00:27:32.780 --> 00:27:35.910
The Shirakawa are putting
much effort in this!


00:27:36.520 --> 00:27:41.480
And among these
performers and...


00:27:41.720 --> 00:27:44.160
Kabuki actors which
they've also called,...


00:27:44.690 --> 00:27:47.890
is a blind laido master.


00:28:10.750 --> 00:28:12.880
That ronin did that?


00:28:14.920 --> 00:28:16.550
How?


00:28:20.090 --> 00:28:21.320
Boss.


00:28:33.910 --> 00:28:37.310
Their wounds look the same like
those of the guys we've found before.


00:28:40.310 --> 00:28:42.610
A straight line, caused
by a backhand grip.


00:28:44.380 --> 00:28:46.580
I didn't know...


00:28:47.390 --> 00:28:50.120
that there's still someone left
who has mastered this technique...


00:29:27.430 --> 00:29:28.760
Oh, master...


00:29:29.400 --> 00:29:30.830
Here, drink!


00:29:33.230 --> 00:29:34.890
Good, good, good.


00:29:35.000 --> 00:29:37.060
That I'm getting
served by the boss...


00:29:37.170 --> 00:29:39.140
What? You don't
have to hold off.


00:29:39.240 --> 00:29:42.440
And the boss is my
father, Choubee Shirakawa.


00:29:43.540 --> 00:29:44.940
Hey, everyone!


00:29:45.580 --> 00:29:49.780
Because Fujihira has come to us,
there's nothing we need to fear anymore.


00:29:49.980 --> 00:29:51.280
Yes!


00:29:51.380 --> 00:29:54.580
He's the guy who has
slaughtered five Banki members!


00:29:55.050 --> 00:29:56.780
Yeah!


00:29:59.030 --> 00:30:01.260
I'm different from my father!


00:30:02.360 --> 00:30:07.230
I don't want to stay silent while
we are despised by the Banki!


00:30:09.440 --> 00:30:12.890
I'm Toraji from
the Shirakawa group.


00:30:13.440 --> 00:30:16.030
Yeah!


00:30:16.140 --> 00:30:18.370
And now drink and eat a lot!


00:30:20.680 --> 00:30:22.980
Oh, you too, master.


00:30:25.420 --> 00:30:27.180
Oh, Kihachi.


00:30:28.520 --> 00:30:29.920
Have you brought her here?


00:30:30.020 --> 00:30:31.220
Yes...


00:31:03.590 --> 00:31:05.320
Oh, we've been
waiting for this!


00:31:11.230 --> 00:31:12.600
Oh.


00:31:16.300 --> 00:31:19.140
You're a pretty
beautiful Goze, huh?


00:31:19.440 --> 00:31:21.200
What's your name?


00:31:21.910 --> 00:31:23.270
My name is Ichi.


00:31:27.450 --> 00:31:29.240
What do you want to hear?


00:31:29.420 --> 00:31:30.970
What, master?


00:31:32.850 --> 00:31:37.260
Oh, no... I don't
know any songs...


00:31:40.660 --> 00:31:42.750
Play something adequate.


00:31:43.530 --> 00:31:44.690
Yes.


00:32:01.450 --> 00:32:07.820
<i>If my mother doesn't
sing for me tonight</i>


00:32:09.260 --> 00:32:16.220
<i>I cannot sleep, when I'm
cradled on their knees</i>


00:32:17.230 --> 00:32:20.170
No, no, no. Hey!


00:32:20.530 --> 00:32:21.690
I didn't mean
something like that.


00:32:22.240 --> 00:32:25.530
Play something with a
more positive atmosphere.


00:32:25.640 --> 00:32:29.400
Play something on your Shamisen
that will motivate our master.


00:32:31.310 --> 00:32:32.400
Yes.


00:32:37.920 --> 00:32:40.820
Oh, this is it! This one!


00:32:44.220 --> 00:32:45.660
Hey, master.


00:33:30.270 --> 00:33:31.500
Kotarou?


00:33:44.420 --> 00:33:48.380
It's me, Touma Fujihira.


00:33:53.430 --> 00:33:56.690
Sorry, sorry. Did
you have to wait long?


00:33:59.470 --> 00:34:00.660
Oh, Tonma.


00:34:01.900 --> 00:34:02.770
It's Touma!


00:34:26.090 --> 00:34:29.220
Toraji gave you
a lot of money!


00:34:30.660 --> 00:34:32.530
Are you listening, miss?


00:34:34.200 --> 00:34:36.330
You did a good job, right?


00:34:58.720 --> 00:35:00.690
Use this as an eye bandage.


00:35:02.200 --> 00:35:06.000
Hm, he has a strange taste.


00:35:12.370 --> 00:35:14.670
You're a greedy woman.


00:35:15.370 --> 00:35:17.670
It's business, after all.


00:35:26.350 --> 00:35:28.910
And don't make the
mistake to touch his face!


00:35:33.060 --> 00:35:35.990
Or you'll never
do business again!


00:36:33.190 --> 00:36:34.590
Oh, master...


00:36:34.850 --> 00:36:37.650
You haven't tried
anything yet.


00:36:38.690 --> 00:36:40.220
Don't you like it?


00:36:40.330 --> 00:36:42.790
Oh, no. That's not the case.


00:36:44.100 --> 00:36:45.960
Since the Banki are here...


00:36:46.170 --> 00:36:49.830
the Bitou Inn has
become quite desolated.


00:36:52.070 --> 00:36:54.800
When Choubee was
healthy back then...


00:36:55.640 --> 00:36:59.630
this was quite a
flourishing inn town.


00:37:10.260 --> 00:37:14.660
If this goes on, the
Bitou Inn will be finished!


00:37:16.560 --> 00:37:22.520
But if you kill the Banki...


00:37:23.840 --> 00:37:28.500
Everyone in this inn town
is begging you to do this.


00:37:28.710 --> 00:37:33.270
So eat a lot and
fortify yourself!


00:37:34.210 --> 00:37:36.150
Eat a lot, OK?


00:37:36.420 --> 00:37:37.780
Eat a lot.


00:37:41.120 --> 00:37:42.680
Where's the toilet?


00:37:43.260 --> 00:37:45.250
At the end of the floor.


00:38:05.650 --> 00:38:07.700
I cannot stand
this much longer.


00:38:08.580 --> 00:38:10.710
This would just be
useless bloodshedding.


00:38:11.050 --> 00:38:13.850
We won't know if
we don't try it.


00:38:16.860 --> 00:38:19.260
To invite Hasshuu...


00:38:21.260 --> 00:38:24.630
and get an repression corps sent
here should be the best solution.


00:38:27.370 --> 00:38:28.960
Are the preparations for
his hospitality being done?


00:38:29.070 --> 00:38:31.200
Sure, the preparations
are being done.


00:38:31.500 --> 00:38:33.970
But isn't it useless to rely
on a government official?


00:38:35.470 --> 00:38:39.070
But no matter how many persons of
doubtful origin you try to gather...


00:38:41.050 --> 00:38:43.710
they would be not
match for the Banki.


00:38:57.400 --> 00:38:59.090
Master!


00:39:00.200 --> 00:39:03.530
Not there! Here!


00:39:06.610 --> 00:39:07.970
Good timing.


00:39:08.510 --> 00:39:09.840
Father.


00:39:10.740 --> 00:39:12.770
This is Fujihira.


00:39:21.220 --> 00:39:24.520
He is far from being a
person of doubtful origin.


00:39:27.660 --> 00:39:29.180
We depend on you.


00:39:40.240 --> 00:39:42.260
Let's have a talk.


00:39:55.290 --> 00:39:58.520
The Banki aren't
normal scoundrels.


00:39:59.460 --> 00:40:02.330
They once were a group
of famous samurai...


00:40:02.930 --> 00:40:05.730
They were so talented that
they were recommended...


00:40:05.830 --> 00:40:09.320
as the swordplay
instructors of the bakufu.


00:40:11.900 --> 00:40:14.170
Why does this man
has it in for you?


00:40:15.980 --> 00:40:18.740
Once, his face got
severely burned...


00:40:19.310 --> 00:40:22.280
There's a rumor that you cannot
look directly at him anymore.


00:40:24.020 --> 00:40:27.380
Because of his
appearance, he finally...


00:40:28.650 --> 00:40:32.150
had been chased away from
his official position...


00:40:34.360 --> 00:40:35.730
And why...


00:40:37.400 --> 00:40:39.190
The Banki gang...


00:40:40.270 --> 00:40:45.230
decide whether we live or die and
they take from us whatever they want.


00:40:46.910 --> 00:40:53.280
But they've already reached the limit
of this. I'm sure the Banki know that.


00:40:55.310 --> 00:40:56.470
So...


00:40:57.520 --> 00:41:01.450
I'm sure they'll just laugh
about our useless hospitality.


00:41:02.690 --> 00:41:04.590
Really, I'm scared!


00:41:09.560 --> 00:41:11.590
I love Toraji.


00:41:13.670 --> 00:41:17.030
I'm really scared
that I'll lose him.


00:41:26.280 --> 00:41:28.940
It seems he doesn't
want to grow old.


00:41:40.590 --> 00:41:42.460
He's an excellent
father, right?


00:41:43.660 --> 00:41:45.860
I have an excellent
father, I guess.


00:41:47.500 --> 00:41:51.060
That he decided to try a
completely different method...


00:42:20.170 --> 00:42:21.260
Here.


00:42:21.370 --> 00:42:24.460
This is an insider
tip from Choubee.


00:42:24.970 --> 00:42:27.630
Oh no! I've
forgotten the float.


00:42:28.240 --> 00:42:31.470
Wait here, miss.
I'll go and get it.


00:42:33.480 --> 00:42:34.450
Oh, Tonma!


00:42:47.830 --> 00:42:50.350
Kotarou seems to like you.


00:42:51.230 --> 00:42:52.860
Do you like children?


00:42:54.730 --> 00:42:56.100
I hate them.


00:42:58.300 --> 00:42:59.830
They're troublesome...


00:43:02.310 --> 00:43:03.780
and noisy.


00:43:09.620 --> 00:43:10.780
But...


00:43:12.550 --> 00:43:17.420
they aren't as dirty as adults,
so it's easier to trust them.


00:43:22.960 --> 00:43:25.360
Adults are dirty?


00:43:27.470 --> 00:43:28.760
Most of them.


00:43:33.270 --> 00:43:34.670
It took the bait.


00:43:36.640 --> 00:43:37.700
Really?


00:43:39.650 --> 00:43:41.140
I don't feel anything.


00:43:47.750 --> 00:43:50.380
Oh, ah, no... oh... this is...


00:43:51.360 --> 00:43:53.480
Here it comes! It's
pulling, it's pulling!


00:44:04.600 --> 00:44:06.400
How could this happen...


00:44:27.130 --> 00:44:32.890
<i>If my mother doesn't
sing for me tonight</i>


00:44:34.370 --> 00:44:39.700
<i>I cannot sleep, when I'm
cradled on their knees</i>


00:44:43.080 --> 00:44:45.040
This is the song
you've sung yesterday.


00:44:46.510 --> 00:44:48.410
How does it go on?


00:44:53.050 --> 00:44:54.780
Even though I've
been abandoned...


00:44:57.420 --> 00:44:59.390
and I don't know his face...


00:45:01.530 --> 00:45:03.460
But I don't hate him.


00:45:06.130 --> 00:45:08.000
I want to meet him again.


00:45:10.840 --> 00:45:12.770
You don't hate him?


00:45:18.380 --> 00:45:20.740
I would love to
hear it completely.


00:45:24.280 --> 00:45:25.880
Maybe there'll
be an opportunity.


00:45:43.270 --> 00:45:46.260
Do you intend to stay in
this inn town for a while?


00:45:48.510 --> 00:45:50.500
Until I've found him.


00:45:52.850 --> 00:45:53.970
I see...


00:46:05.790 --> 00:46:07.050
Soon...


00:46:07.530 --> 00:46:11.330
the Shirakawa group and the Banki
gang might cross their swords.


00:46:14.770 --> 00:46:16.890
Do you intend to help them?


00:46:21.940 --> 00:46:25.070
You know, I'm the bodyguard
of the Shirakawa group.


00:46:28.950 --> 00:46:30.440
You want to interfere...


00:46:32.020 --> 00:46:33.040
What?


00:46:36.020 --> 00:46:40.290
But if you don't do that in a moderate
way, you'll get in a lot of trouble.


00:46:44.530 --> 00:46:46.020
Like you?


00:46:46.130 --> 00:46:48.530
I cannot look away when
my comrades are in trouble.


00:46:54.840 --> 00:46:56.670
If I were as
skilled as you are...


00:46:56.940 --> 00:46:59.310
I'm sure I could've
saved the battered Goze.


00:47:07.990 --> 00:47:09.420
I don't know what
happened to you before,...


00:47:10.690 --> 00:47:13.250
but why are you so much afraid of
being involved with other people?


00:47:19.060 --> 00:47:21.160
People who cannot see...


00:47:23.170 --> 00:47:25.640
don't know what borders are.


00:47:28.310 --> 00:47:30.540
They don't know whether
it's noon or night...


00:47:31.310 --> 00:47:34.180
or where the way they're
walking on is suddenly ending...


00:47:34.810 --> 00:47:36.800
They cannot see the borders.


00:47:38.420 --> 00:47:40.540
They are afraid
because they cannot see.


00:47:42.150 --> 00:47:44.380
Who is bad and who is good...


00:47:44.560 --> 00:47:47.150
Where's the border
between them?


00:47:47.930 --> 00:47:50.120
I don't even know that.


00:47:51.100 --> 00:47:53.560
Whether I'm living or dying...


00:47:53.770 --> 00:47:55.790
I cannot see
even that clearly!


00:48:06.040 --> 00:48:07.410
I don't really think...


00:48:09.050 --> 00:48:12.040
that I want to live anyway.


00:48:30.900 --> 00:48:32.000
Wait!


00:48:38.210 --> 00:48:39.940
Fight with me using this.


00:48:42.510 --> 00:48:44.280
Stop it, Tonma.


00:48:44.380 --> 00:48:46.720
You are no match for her.


00:49:13.750 --> 00:49:15.080
Let's start!


00:50:04.930 --> 00:50:07.090
Everything seems to
be proceeding well.


00:50:07.630 --> 00:50:10.600
I'm sure this will
make Hasshuu very happy.


00:50:11.870 --> 00:50:12.960
Yes.


00:50:13.570 --> 00:50:15.600
Well, I hope this will
go for the Banki, too.


00:50:15.970 --> 00:50:19.670
So that they'll be quiet while
Hasshuu resides in this inn town.


00:50:33.430 --> 00:50:37.590
Sorry, I've accidentally put
too much strength into it.


00:50:39.660 --> 00:50:40.860
Does it hurt?


00:50:43.770 --> 00:50:46.530
You're even stronger
than her, Tonma.


00:50:47.870 --> 00:50:51.810
Yes. I'm strong.


00:50:54.780 --> 00:50:57.180
But that's just with a stick.


00:50:59.580 --> 00:51:02.110
I can't draw a katana.


00:51:03.990 --> 00:51:05.650
What do you mean by that?


00:51:12.900 --> 00:51:14.130
I...


00:51:15.370 --> 00:51:18.700
was born in the house of a martial
arts instructor of the Odaka clan.


00:51:40.790 --> 00:51:41.990
Touma!


00:51:46.330 --> 00:51:47.820
Mother!


00:51:51.940 --> 00:51:54.530
She didn't die, but...


00:51:57.310 --> 00:51:59.300
she had lost her eyesight.


00:52:06.490 --> 00:52:08.610
Since then...


00:52:08.790 --> 00:52:11.520
I cannot draw my katana.


00:52:13.390 --> 00:52:15.950
But with a wooden
sword I can't lose.


00:52:16.060 --> 00:52:17.890
I had a lot of
self-confidence in my skills.


00:52:19.830 --> 00:52:21.360
But he thought
that it would be...


00:52:21.500 --> 00:52:26.130
a shame for the family, if the successor of
an instructor couldn't draw his sword anymore.


00:52:27.870 --> 00:52:30.640
After that, my father
started to dislike me.


00:52:34.280 --> 00:52:38.770
Five years ago, my father
adopted his best disciple...


00:52:39.920 --> 00:52:42.320
and passed the
inheritance on to him.


00:52:46.460 --> 00:52:48.930
And I went on a journey in
the pursuit of knowledge.


00:52:52.760 --> 00:52:54.960
This is my current situation.


00:52:59.440 --> 00:53:02.600
Only my mother was kind to
me, even after she went blind.


00:53:04.240 --> 00:53:06.710
She always dreamed that
I would become a Samurai...


00:53:06.810 --> 00:53:08.340
and that's why she
always motivated me.


00:53:10.920 --> 00:53:15.180
When I was fifteen, my mother
died because of an illness.


00:53:17.860 --> 00:53:22.950
Even though she was seriously ill,
she desperately tried to live on.


00:53:25.600 --> 00:53:27.390
Even though she was blind.


00:53:28.170 --> 00:53:30.460
She didn't give up
her hope to live on.


00:53:32.400 --> 00:53:36.000
She wanted to live on...


00:53:39.910 --> 00:53:41.880
But that wish
didn't come true.


00:54:01.730 --> 00:54:03.030
This...


00:54:04.940 --> 00:54:06.490
This is how I am.


00:55:42.800 --> 00:55:45.400
Hasshuu has arrived!


00:55:45.740 --> 00:55:47.430
Hey, please hurry, everyone!


00:57:20.030 --> 00:57:21.690
Really?


00:57:22.200 --> 00:57:25.330
So the person you were
looking for isn't here?


00:58:08.810 --> 00:58:10.510
Are you leaving the inn town?


00:59:12.340 --> 00:59:14.680
Let's go!


00:59:20.850 --> 00:59:22.010
They've lied.


00:59:22.690 --> 00:59:23.350
Boss!


00:59:46.950 --> 00:59:47.810
They've lied.

